v2 redesign 11/26

Editing the site
- Pages and posts are .qmd files; news posts live in posts/.
- Pushing to main rebuilds docs/ automatically (.github/workflows/render.yml).
- Posts with R code (posts/loading_gridex.qmd) are frozen in _freeze/.
  If you change one, render it locally with R first and commit _freeze/.
- Theme: confluence.scss (colors, type, layout) and styles.css (fonts,
  contour backgrounds). Fonts are self-hosted in fonts/ (SIL OFL).
